    <ol class="workflow-steps">
      <li><div><strong>Property Record Intake</strong>The Equity Reaper receives deed transfers, mortgage satisfactions, lien releases in real time via county recorder API. Each filing updates the property's net equity score automatically. No human decision required.<span class="doctrine-tag">[Doctrine: Tyler MSA Blanket Integration · IJIS Springboard]</span></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Vulnerability Index Calculation</strong>Court record history cross-referenced. Prior forfeiture case types flagged. Warrant status checked. Movement patterns from ALPR data assessed. Attorney of record history evaluated. Contestability score assigned.<span class="doctrine-tag">[Doctrine: HSI AIRG Handbook — Pre-Seizure Analysis]</span></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Demographic Profile Update</strong>Vehicle registration, business license, and residential address records maintained. Household composition inferred from movement co-location data. Community association map updated.<span class="doctrine-tag">[Doctrine: Third-Party Doctrine]</span></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Threshold Breach Alert</strong>When net equity crosses seizure threshold — $20,000 real property — property enters active pre-seizure analysis queue. <span class="rx" data-len="──────">&nbsp;</span> severance payments produced a documented wave of mortgage satisfaction filings in The Equity Reaper and <span class="rx" data-len="─────────────────">&nbsp;</span> counties, August–October 2025. Each filing was a threshold event.<span class="doctrine-tag">[Doctrine: HSI AIRG Handbook — Seizure Threshold Definition]</span></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Quarterly Inspection Assignment</strong>Properties in active queue assigned to <span class="rx" data-len="────">&nbsp;</span> quarterly inspection rotation. Drive-by condition verification scheduled. Pre-seizure file opened. The property owner does not know.<span class="doctrine-tag">[Doctrine: HSI AIRG Handbook §4.5]</span></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Harvest Calendar Integration</strong>Scored properties mapped against fiscal year close — September 30. High-priority properties flagged for summer operation window. The calm before named operations is the Ledger updating its queue.<span class="doctrine-tag">[Doctrine: TFF No-Year Budget Authority · 31 USC §9703]</span></div></li>
