      <div class="doctrine-actual">Actual operation: The same company that manages court records, property records, asset forfeiture case types, and ALPR data also manages public health incident detection, benefits eligibility, and case lifecycle management. The data flows through one platform. The authorization exists in MSA boilerplate. No agency voted on the integration.</div>
